WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.567
-Welcome back to the show,
everybody.

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:04.234
Give it up once again
for our bandleader tonight,

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:05.634
Robert Glasper in the house.

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:09.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.801
Ooh! Different color vinyl
right here.

00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:16.901
Ooh, look at this.
Ooh. Come on.

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:21.334
I saw Robert at the Blue Note
not too long ago,

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:23.601
a couple of weeks ago,
and it was phenomenal.

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:25.367
You were so great.
-Thank you.

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:27.434
-It's just if you ever
get a chance to see Robert --

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:28.834
well, you are seeing him live --

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:33.234
but to just see the whole
experience, the whole thing,

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:34.968
I've never seen
anything like it.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.601
Who's your deejay?

00:00:36.601 --> 00:00:37.634
-Jahi Sundance.

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:39.467
-Oh, my gosh, he was so great.

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:40.968
And he's deejaying
as you're doing

00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:44.267
and you're playing jazz.
And it's just -- it's like,

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:46.434
you don't know what kind of
is going to happen next.

00:00:46.434 --> 00:00:48.501
And at one point you started,
like, whistling

00:00:48.501 --> 00:00:52.067
in the song and you're like...
[ Whistles ]

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:54.300
And you did it. And it kind
of worked perfectly.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.634
And I go, "Wow,
this guy is brilliant."

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:56.968
And then the song ended.

00:00:56.968 --> 00:00:58.868
I don't know if you remember
this. It made me laugh.

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:02.601
You started whistle
conversationing with him.

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:03.767
-Oh, that's right. That's right.

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:06.100
-You you were like,
you started going like...

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:07.734
[ Laughs ]

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.467
I can't do it while I'm
laughing, but you're like...

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:11.767
[ Whistling ]

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:14.167
-[ Whistling ]

00:01:14.234 --> 00:01:16.734
-[ Whistling ]

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:22.067
-[ Whistling ]

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:23.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.868 --> 00:01:25.901
-[ Whistles ]

00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:28.601
-[ Whistling ]

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:31.968
-[ Whistling ]

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:34.567
-[ Whistling ]

00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:37.701
-[ Whistling ]

00:01:37.701 --> 00:01:41.400
♪♪

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.834
[ Both whistling ]

00:01:42.834 --> 00:01:45.133
♪♪

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:46.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:52.767
♪♪

00:01:52.767 --> 00:01:58.601
♪♪

00:01:58.601 --> 00:02:00.367
[ Whistling continuing ]

00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:08.334
♪♪

00:02:08.334 --> 00:02:16.267
♪♪

